Speech: transcription, diarization, speaker embeddings (Sources/AthenaTranscription/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Whisper (architecture; Athena-authored MLX implementation)
  Copyright (c) OpenAI. MIT License. https://github.com/openai/whisper

Parakeet-TDT (NVIDIA; Athena-authored MLX-Swift port)
  NVIDIA NeMo. Apache License 2.0. https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo
