Sortformer diarization (Sources/AthenaTranscription/Sortformer/)
  Vendored from Blaizzy/mlx-audio-swift (MIT License), which ports the NVIDIA
  NeMo Sortformer model (Apache License 2.0).
  https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-audio  •  https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo

pyannote PyanNet speaker segmentation (Sources/AthenaTranscription/Pyannote/)
