WeSpeaker speaker embeddings (Sources/AthenaTranscription/WeSpeaker/)
  Vendored from soniqo/speech-swift (Apache License 2.0). Implements the
  WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM model from wenet-e2e/wespeaker (Apache License 2.0).
  https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker

