================================================================================
Build/runtime dependencies resolved via SwiftPM (not vendored)
================================================================================

Athena links, but does not copy, a number of Swift packages (MLX / mlx-swift-lm,
swift-transformers, swift-huggingface, Hummingbird, swift-nio, swift-crypto,
swift-argument-parser, swift-log, swift-service-lifecycle, AppleSiliconMetrics).
Each is fetched at build time and carries its own license; see Package.swift and
Package.resolved for the exact set and pinned revisions.
